# vendors

- `@senbilan/vendors/ui` holds customized Taiga/Ionic wrappers + `--tui-*` / `--ion-*` bridges.
- Pure product primitives stay in `design-system/ui`.
- Stock vendor (no API change) → import only from `apps/*`.
- Features/entities consume wrappers from this lib or DS — never raw `@taiga-ui/*` / `@ionic/*`.
- Goal: shrink this lib over time and drop Taiga.
